1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:02,837
69 foiz ovoz… bitta katta qaror!

2
00:00:02,837 --> 00:00:05,746
ZAMIN FK endi kelajak yulduzlarini tarbiyalaydi!

3
00:00:05,966 --> 00:00:07,888
Siz tanladingiz — YOSHLAR AKADEMIYASI!

4
00:00:07,888 --> 00:00:11,175
Muxlislarning 69 foizi aynan shu yo‘nalishni tanladi.

5
00:00:11,175 --> 00:00:12,946
Demak, kelajak bugundan boshlanadi!

6
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:15,680
Bu orada stadionimiz ham o‘zgarishda davom etmoqda!

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:18,342
Maydon atrofida yangi reklama bannerlari paydo bo‘ldi!

8
00:00:18,342 --> 00:00:20,954
ZAMIN FK endi tobora haqiqiy klubga o‘xshab bormoqda!

9
00:00:21,174 --> 00:00:23,158
Videomiz yana 142 ta layk oldi!

10
00:00:23,158 --> 00:00:26,088
Klub fondiga yana 2 130 000 so‘m qo‘shildi!

11
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:29,199
Jami virtual fondimiz — 25 590 000 so‘m!

12
00:00:29,419 --> 00:00:31,599
Va bugungi eng faol muxlislarimiz…

13
00:00:31,599 --> 00:00:35,510
@wrr_718 va @Nursulton12340!

14
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,626
ZAMIN FK sizlarni ko‘rib turibdi!

15
00:00:37,846 --> 00:00:38,971
Akademiyamizni ochdik…

16
00:00:38,971 --> 00:00:41,324
Lekin uni boshqaradigan menejerimiz hali yo‘q!

17
00:00:41,544 --> 00:00:43,734
ZAMIN FK yoshlar akademiyasiga menejer kerak!

18
00:00:43,734 --> 00:00:45,438
Eng ko‘p layk to‘plagan muxlisimiz…

19
00:00:45,438 --> 00:00:47,531
Akademiyamizning birinchi menejeri bo‘ladi!

20
00:00:47,751 --> 00:00:50,933
Faqat bitta shart — @zaminfk_bot ga ulangan bo‘lishingiz kerak!

21
00:00:50,933 --> 00:00:53,510
Nomzod bo‘lish uchun izohga yozing: MEN MENEJERMAN!

22
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:56,036
24 soatdan keyin g‘olibni e’lon qilamiz!

23
00:00:56,036 --> 00:00:58,309
Kelajak yulduzlari… endi sizning qo‘lingizda!

